/* ENVLP Windows resources.
 *
 * The manifest is what makes Windows load Common-Controls 6.0, which
 * wxWidgets 3.3 requires (GetWindowSubclass & friends are exported by
 * name only from comctl32 v6). Resource id 1 with type 24 (RT_MANIFEST)
 * is the process manifest.
 *
 * The icon is declared twice from the same file: once with the integer id 1
 * (which is what Explorer and the taskbar use for the .exe) and once with a
 * *name*, because wxWidgets loads an icon resource by name, not by id.
 * ENVLP.ico is built from ENVLP.svg by tools/make_icon.ps1. */
1 24 "ENVLP.manifest"
1 ICON "ENVLP.ico"
ENVLP_APP ICON "ENVLP.ico"
